				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				718,
				8
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Fix vscode-file:// URI resolution for extension assets\n\nAdd handling for absolute OS paths in the vscode-file:// scheme handler.\nVS Code extensions generate URIs like `vscode-file://vscode-app/Volumes/.../seti.woff`\nafter `FileAccess.uriToBrowserUri` rewrites extension paths. Detect common\nmacOS/Linux absolute path roots (Volumes, Users, Library, etc.) and serve\nfiles directly from disk instead of trying to resolve against Sky/Target.\n\nAlso add NLS placeholder resolution to the extension scanner. VS Code extensions\nuse `%key%` placeholders in package.json referencing `package.nls.json` entries.\nWithout this, the Command Palette and menus displayed literal `%command.clone%`,\n`%displayName%` strings. The scanner now loads NLS bundles and recursively replaces\nplaceholders in all string fields before parsing as ExtensionDescriptionStateDTO.\n\nAdditional improvements:\n- Downgrade benign \"Resource not found\" 404s in FileSystem.ReadFile to info-level\n  (extensions probe for optional cache files on activate)\n- Remove unused empty_ticks counter in Cocoon health monitor\n- Fix remaining PascalCase module references (ReadOperations, Messaging)\n- Simplify user extension path to only `.land/extensions`\n\nThese fixes enable proper loading of extension-contributed icon themes,\ngrammars, and localization.",
			"SHA": "336b21a62b258af6641298869881ccc293cd610c"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-17T16:11:37Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				718,
				21
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete PascalCase naming migration for RPC modules\n\nRename all remaining snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the RPC layer:\n- commands.rs → Commands.rs\n- configuration.rs → Configuration.rs\n- debug.rs → Debug.rs\n- processes.rs → Processes.rs\n- scm.rs → SCM.rs\n- telemetry.rs → Telemetry.rs\n- terminals.rs → Terminals.rs\n- types.rs → Types.rs\n- vine.rs → Vine.rs\n- windows.rs → Windows.rs\n- workspace.rs → Workspace.rs\n\nAlso remove deprecated/unused service modules that have been refactored elsewhere:\n- CommandService.rs, Command/Validation/mod.rs\n- SecretStorageService.rs, SecretStorageState.rs\n- WindowService.rs, WindowState.rs\n- WorkspaceService.rs\n- Telemetry/Metrics/mod.rs, Telemetry/Spans/mod.rs\n\nUpdate mod.rs to use explicit #[path] attributes for all modules, replacing implicit snake_case resolution. This completes the PascalCase migration for the RPC subsystem, following the pattern established in previous commits for Environment, LanguageFeature, and other modules.",
			"SHA": "5ba4958acbcc759748ae3037a2f0e75bdbf81d88"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-17T16:05:39Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				732,
				15
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete PascalCase naming migration for Environment and LanguageFeature modules\n\nRename remaining snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the Mountain codebase:\n\n- LanguageFeature: validation.rs → Validation.rs, hover.rs → Hover.rs, highlights.rs → Highlights.rs, completions.rs → Completions.rs, definition.rs → Definition.rs, references.rs → References.rs\n- StatusBarProvider: tooltip.rs → Tooltip.rs\n- WebviewProvider: lifecycle.rs → Lifecycle.rs, configuration.rs → Configuration.rs, messaging.rs → Messaging.rs\n\nUpdate all module references and function calls in parent modules to use the new PascalCase names. Also standardize function names to PascalCase (provide_Tooltip_impl).\n\nThis completes the PascalCase migration started in the previous commit, ensuring consistent naming conventions across the entire Mountain codebase.",
			"SHA": "9c0dce8c1b67b442e5ec12ad638d9f6f5baa263f"
		},
