				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				732,
				19
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Adopt PascalCase naming and simplify binary configuration\n\nRename all snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the Mountain codebase:\n- LanguageFeature: code_actions.rs → CodeActions.rs, invoke_provider.rs → InvokeProvider.rs\n- FileSystemProvider: read_operations.rs → ReadOperations.rs, write_operations.rs → WriteOperations.rs\n- StatusBarProvider: entry_management.rs → EntryManagement.rs, message_management.rs → MessageManagement.rs\n- RPC: echo_action.rs → EchoAction.rs\n\nAlso simplify the binary/library names in Cargo.toml and tauri.conf.json from the verbose development identifier `DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_Mountain` back to `Mountain`, and remove the externalBin reference to Binary/node.\n\nThis aligns with the CodeEditorLand PascalCase naming convention and removes development-specific configuration artifacts.",
			"SHA": "3461db4f7ae8b09eacca0216c8fa85521797b25f"
		}
